    given-names: "Christos"
title: "Ascoos OS — Pure PHP Web 5.0 and WebAI Kernel"
version: "1.0.0-alpha-development"
date-released: 2025-08-01
url: "https://github.com/ascoos/os"
keywords:
  - "Ascoos OS"
  - "Web 5.0"
  - "WebAI"
  - "PHP Kernel"
  - "CiC Technology"
  - "Cross-Interpreter Communication"
  - "JML Markup Language"
  - "DoBu Documentation DSL"
  - "JSQLDB"
  - "IoT Integration"
  - "Macro Engine"
  - "AWES"
  - "BootLib"
  - "Decentralized Web"
abstract: >-
  Ascoos OS is a pure PHP Web 5.0 and WebAI kernel designed for decentralized,
  modular, and AI-assisted web applications. It integrates a dynamic core class
  system, IoT support, a macro engine with DSL/AST, the JML markup language,
  the DoBu documentation DSL, the CiC cross-interpreter communication layer,
  and a complete development environment through Ascoos Web Extended Studio.
  It serves as the foundation for next-generation Web 5.0 and WebAI architectures.
